# Figure + glossary images are optimized to .webp and referenced as such.
# Keep the .png sources in the repo, but don't ship them to Vercel — they are
# what bloated the deploy ("Deploying outputs" timeout). Chapter covers
# (fig-00) and backgrounds (fig-99) stay PNG and are kept.
apps/web/public/images/glossary/*.png
apps/web/public/images/chapters/**/fig-*.png
!apps/web/public/images/chapters/**/fig-00-cover.png
!apps/web/public/images/chapters/**/fig-99-background.png
